WEBVTT

00:10:01.017 --> 00:10:05.818
food given to us lovingly by Mother Earth
according to her own rhythm,

00:10:06.718 --> 00:10:10.864
food prepared by our foremothers with joy

00:10:10.888 --> 00:10:13.768
and are eaten by our forefathers
with gratitude,

00:10:14.786 --> 00:10:19.487
food that is healthy, local, natural,

00:10:19.511 --> 00:10:22.311
varied, delicious,

00:10:22.335 --> 00:10:25.312
not requiring cultivation,

00:10:25.336 --> 00:10:27.477
not damaging our ecology,

00:10:27.501 --> 00:10:29.106
not costing a thing?